{"id":"mayori_a","lemma":"mayoría","pos":"noun","rank":683,"glosses":["majority"],"ipa":"/maʝoˈɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mayorías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mayor%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"La mayoría de ello está en francés.","en":"Most of it's in French.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302495","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"La mayoría de la gente es idiota.","en":"Most people are idiots.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460902","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"people"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"idiot"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Él ganó la elección por una gran mayoría.","en":"He won the election by a large majority.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77659","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"election"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"La mayoría nunca se equivoca.","en":"The majority is never wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694600","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"never"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to mistake, mix up","l":"equivocar"}]},{"text":"La mayoría de ellos son canadienses.","en":"Most of them are Canadians.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302333","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"Canadian","l":"canadiense"}]}]}